<title>JAPAN: Japan Telecom - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Japan Telecom - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		183.17		vs	  164.00</p>
<p> Operating	   22.81		vs	   24.65</p>
<p> Current	     22.06		vs	   23.42</p>
<p> Net		   13.23		vs	   11.99</p>
<p> EPS	     31,953.35 yen	  vs     28,955.79 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     414 million	 vs	  414 million</p>
<p> Interim div     3000.00 yen	  vs	 2500.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Japan Telecom Co Ltd is a long-distance telephone company affiliated with the Japan Railway group.</p>
</text>
